flowchart LR
 Docs[Plans / Specs / Addenda / RFIs / Submittals] --> Parse[Document Intelligence]
 Parse --> Evidence[Page/Sheet/Section Evidence]
 Evidence --> Retrieve[Permission-Aware Retrieval]
 Retrieve --> Agent[Plan / Spec / Scope Agent]
 Agent --> Candidate[Finding / Quantity / Service Candidate]
 Candidate --> Confidence[Confidence + Conflict Check]
 Confidence --> Review[Human Review when required]
 Review --> P26[Deterministic Estimate Tools]
